{"createdAt":"2026-10-01T03:25:29.922Z","data":{"body":[{"_key":"p1","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"p0","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"GitHub Student Packとは？"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"h1"},{"_key":"p3","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"p2","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"GitHubが学生に対して有料のソフトウェアや無料のサーバークレジット、GitHub Proプランなどを無料で提供しているパッケージの名前です。"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"p5","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"p4","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"日本だと、学生証の写真とか、学校発行のeメールアドレスとかを登録するだけで使えます。総額いくらなのかわかりませんが、使いきれないくらいの量があるので、GitHub使う人は絶対に登録しましょう。やらないと損なレベル。"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"}],"description":"","emoji":"⚒️","exclude_from_listing":0,"is_translated":0,"is_work_in_progress":1,"legacy_editable":{"description":"","emoji":"⚒️","exclude_from_listing":false,"is_translated":false,"is_work_in_progress":true,"legacy_published_at":"2025-10-05","tags":["coding","team-dev","dev"],"title":"GitHub Student Pack"},"legacy_frontmatter":{"emoji":"⚒️","isDraft":true,"published_at":"2025-10-05","tags":["coding","team-dev","dev"],"title":"GitHub Student Pack"},"legacy_path":"ja/misc/github-student-pack.md","legacy_published_at":"2025-10-05","public_path":"ja/misc/github-student-pack","tags":["coding","team-dev","dev"],"title":"GitHub Student Pack"},"id":"01M3TQXSY203YPHCFP9Z11MYWP","locale":"ja","publishedAt":"2025-10-05T00:00:00.000Z","seo":{"canonical":null,"description":null,"image":null,"noIndex":false,"title":null},"slug":"github-student-pack","translationGroup":"01M3TQXSY203YPHCFP9Z11MYWP"}
